{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it. Then, if object is nearby, pick it up. Finally, do tasks with object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectNearby    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
